<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia seeks 100,000 tonnes soft wheat - trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia seeks 100,000 tonnes soft wheat - trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia has launched a tender for Thursday to purchase four lots or more of 25,000 tonnes each of soft wheat for March-April shipment, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Shipment dates are -</p>
<p>     1-10 March 1997 25,000 tonnes</p>
<p>    10-20 March	25,000 tonnes</p>
<p>    20-31 March	25,000 tonnes</p>
<p>    01-10 April	25,000 tonnes</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
